# No question popups

Never use the `AskQuestion` tool (multiple choice forms or questionnaires). The user hates them.

- Make the sensible call yourself and do the work.
- If something truly needs the user's input, ask one short plain text question at the end of your reply.
- Never end a turn with a form or a list of options to pick from.

```text
❌ Calling AskQuestion with "Option A / Option B / Option C"
✅ "Done. One thing to confirm: is Jaguar 6 or 7 guests?"
```
